# Python Rules

- Target Python 3.10+
- Use `argparse` for CLI tools
- Use `pathlib.Path` over `os.path`
- Include type hints on function signatures
- Use `if __name__ == "__main__":` guard
- Prefer Marker for PDF-to-markdown conversion (better quality than PyMuPDF alone)
